        <p class="lede">
          PB2 Performance is the only PB2 product built as a protein powder: per the label at the time of writing, a 45 g serving gives 20 g of protein in 190 calories. Original PB2 and PB2 Pure give 6 g per 13 g serving, so they work as flavor, not as a shake base. Below: labels, sugar and salt, testing, taste reports and cost per 25 g of protein.
        </p>

