              <summary><h3>How much protein is in PB2 powdered peanut butter?</h3></summary>
              <div class="faq-answer">
                <p>
                  Original PB2 and PB2 Pure contain 6 g of protein per 2 tablespoon (13 g) serving, per PB2. PB2 with Cocoa has 4 g. PB2 Performance, the protein powder line, has 20 g per 45 g serving, and the retail-only Performance Pure lists 22 g. So the Performance jars carry over three times as much protein per serving.
                </p>
